<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mi Landing</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header.ejs') %>

    <!-- first part hero  -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="heroText">
            <h1>Speak real Spanish and
            feel at home in Latin
            America</h1>
            <p>Dynamic, natural conversation
            classes for professionals and retirees
            ready for true local integration.</p>
            <button><a href="#programs" class="btn">Book your Diagnostic Session</a></button>
        </div>
    
        <div class="heroImage">
            <img src="/images/hero.jpg" alt="Video">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- second part problems -->
    <section id="problems" class="problems">
        <div class="problesTitle">
            <h2>Does this sound like
            you?</h2>
        </div>
    
        <div class="problemsText">
            <p>Know some words, but fear is holding you
            back from speaking?</p>
            <p>Stuck in a "tourist bubble" and struggling
            to build a local network?</p>
            <p>Tired of dry grammar drills that don't
            help in real life?</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cta">
        <p>You don't need perfect grammar to speak with
        confidence. With the Frazeando method, you'll
        turn isolated words into fluent conversations
        through structured practice and ultra-small groups
        —starting your very first week.</p>
        <button>Book your Diagnostic Session</button>
    </div>


    <script type="module" src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>

</html>